 "eed937c0754bedbae6c8243c75d725c8815607c6ab911fab8aafa88bf99d9194": {
  "content": "Welcome to the UK! Starting with a \"thin file\" is completely normal for international students. \n\nTo build your UK credit history step-by-step:\n1. **Secure your proof of address** (tenancy agreement or university letter) [KB: Credit-building basics (UK)].\n2. **Open a UK current account** and use it for daily spending [KB: Credit-building basics (UK)].\n3. **Move to a monthly phone contract** paid by direct debit to establish a steady payment record [KB: Credit-building basics (UK)].\n\nWould you like me to save the 6-month credit-building plan to your tasks so you can track your progress?",
  "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
  "provider": "gemini",
